\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Requests are counted against the credential that presented them.\",\n      \"line\": 3,\n      \"span\": \"Requests are counted against the credential that presented them\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Requests are counted over a fixed window of 60 seconds.\",\n      \"line\": 3,\n      \"span\": \"over a fixed window of 60 seconds\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Requests are never counted against a connection.\",\n      \"line\": 3,\n      \"span\": \"never against a connection\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Opening a second socket provides no benefit to a caller.\",\n      \"line\": 3,\n      \"span\": \"Opening a second socket therefore buys a caller nothing\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"A client spread across multiple worker processes is throttled at exactly the point a single process would have been.\",\n      \"line\": 3,\n      \"span\": \"A client spread across multiple worker processes is throttled at exactly the point a single process would have been\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"A client spread across multiple worker processes pays for the extra file descriptors.\",\n      \"line\": 3,\n      \"span\": \"pays for the extra file descriptors as well\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The default allowance is 100 requests in a window.\",\n      \"line\": 5,\n      \"span\": \"The default allowance is 100 requests in a window\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"A credential marked for batch work is allowed 1000 requests in the same window.\",\n      \"line\": 5,\n      \"span\": \"a credential marked for batch work is allowed 1000 in the same window\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Callers that retry at once are the largest single reason the cap is there at all.\",\n      \"line\": 5,\n      \"span\": \"Callers that retry at once are the largest single reason the cap is there at all\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The refusal carries a Retry-After header with a whole number of seconds to wait.\",\n      \"line\": 9,\n      \"span\": \"The refusal carries a Retry-After header with a whole number of seconds to wait\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The gateway keeps no memory of who backed off politely.\",\n      \"line\": 9,\n      \"span\": \"The gateway keeps no memory of who backed off politely\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Waiting longer than the header asks earns a caller no credit at all.\",\n      \"line\": 9,\n      \"span\": \"waiting longer than the header asks earns a caller no credit at all\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The body of the refusal is JSON.\",\n      \"line\": 11,\n      \"span\": \"The body of the refusal is JSON\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The body names what the gateway calls the \\\"window\\\" it counted in, the cap, and the tier.\",\n      \"line\": 11,\n      \"span\": \"it names what the gateway calls the \\\"window\\\" it counted in, the cap, and the tier as well\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"None of those fields is a substitute for the header.\",\n      \"line\": 11,\n      \"span\": \"None of those fields is a substitute for the header\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The gateway has already done that arithmetic, with information the caller does not have.\",\n      \"line\": 17,\n      \"span\": \"The gateway has already done that arithmetic, with information the caller does not have\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The gateway does the same on the 503 path.\",\n      \"line\": 17,\n      \"span\": \"it does the same on the 503 path\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"A 200 wants nothing.\",\n      \"line\": 19,\n      \"span\": \"A 200 wants nothing\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"A 429 wants the stated wait.\",\n      \"line\": 19,\n      \"span\": \"a 429 wants the stated wait\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"A 500 may be retried once that wait has passed.\",\n      \"line\": 19,\n      \"span\": \"a 500 may be retried once that wait has passed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"A 503 is the overload path.\",\n      \"line\": 19,\n      \"span\": \"a 503 is the overload path\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The four cases are not interchangeable.\",\n      \"line\": 19,\n      \"span\": \"The four cases are not interchangeable\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"A batch credential is allowed 1000 requests in a window, measured over exactly the same window.\",\n      \"line\": 21,\n      \"span\": \"A batch credential is allowed 1000 requests in a window, measured over exactly the same window\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The tier is set on the credential when it is issued.\",\n      \"line\": 21,\n      \"span\": \"The tier is set on the credential when it is issued\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The tier cannot be asked for per call.\",\n      \"line\": 21,\n      \"span\": \"cannot be asked for per call\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Nothing else about the two tiers differs in any way.\",\n      \"line\": 21,\n      \"span\": \"Nothing else about the two tiers differs in any way\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"A caller that cannot say how often it was refused last week cannot argue for a larger cap.\",\n      \"line\": 23,\n      \"span\": \"A caller that cannot say how often it was refused last week cannot argue for a larger cap\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Nobody at the far end will assemble that argument on the caller's behalf.\",\n      \"line\": 23,\n      \"span\": \"nobody at the far end will assemble that argument on its behalf\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Not all 429 responses are due to caps.\",\n      \"line\": 27,\n      \"span\": \"Not all 429 responses are due to caps\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"A credential may be suspended as a reason for gateway refusal.\",\n      \"line\": 27,\n      \"span\": \"a credential may be suspended\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"A route may be closed for maintenance as a reason for gateway refusal.\",\n      \"line\": 27,\n      \"span\": \"a route may be closed for maintenance\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"A body may exceed the 5 megabyte limit as a reason for gateway refusal.\",\n      \"line\": 27,\n      \"span\": \"a body may exceed the 5 megabyte limit\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"None of those three reasons clear itself by waiting for a stated number of seconds.\",\n      \"line\": 27,\n      \"span\": \"None of those three clears itself by waiting for a stated number of seconds\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"A loop that waits and retries against a suspended credential spends its whole budget without ever reaching the service.\",\n      \"line\": 29,\n      \"span\": \"A loop that waits and retries against a suspended credential spends its whole budget without ever reaching the service\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The log afterwards shows nothing at all except a long run of refusals.\",\n      \"line\": 29,\n      \"span\": \"the log afterwards shows nothing at all except a long run of refusals\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Reading the status code rather than the class it belongs to separates the two cases.\",\n      \"line\": 29,\n      \"span\": \"Reading the status code rather than the class it belongs to is what separates the two cases\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"A cap can be raised.\",\n      \"line\": 33,\n      \"span\": \"A cap can be raised\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The number of caps raised without a measurement behind them is zero.\",\n      \"line\": 33,\n      \"span\": \"the number of caps raised without a measurement behind them is zero\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"A burst is cheaper to smooth than it is to serve at its peak.\",\n      \"line\": 33,\n      \"span\": \"a burst is cheaper to smooth than it is to serve at its peak\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"A caller that can move half its work to a quieter hour usually gets what it needs without any change to the cap at all.\",\n      \"line\": 33,\n      \"span\": \"A caller that can move half its work to a quieter hour usually gets what it needs without any change to the cap at all\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Requests reach the platform team through the usual channel.\",\n      \"line\": 35,\n      \"span\": \"Requests reach the platform team through the usual channel\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Requests are answered within two working days.\",\n      \"line\": 35,\n      \"span\": \"they are answered within two working days\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"There is no expedited path.\",\n      \"line\": 35,\n      \"span\": \"There is no expedited path\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"There is no exception list.\",\n      \"line\": 35,\n      \"span\": \"no exception list\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```","ttft_ms":87376,"type":"result","duration_ms":98607,"uuid":"702e06c1-5d0e-437c-acfd-feaf98d5ad69","ttft_stream_ms":880,"time_to_request_ms":92,"first_content_frame_ms":881,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
